sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-kondo-pomacanthus-stripe-insertion> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-kondo-pomacanthus-stripe-insertion-overall> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-kondo-pomacanthus-stripe-insertion-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Kondo & Asai (1995) Pomacanthus reaction-diffusion stripe insertion & Y-branch unzipping — MorphoEval overall 92.0/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Pass 2 post-remediation evaluation of `1995-kondo-pomacanthus-stripe-insertion.py` (92.0/100, up from 54.7/100 in Pass 1; +37.3 overall). The remediated script integrates the nonlinear 1D and 2D Kondo & Asai (1995) piecewise-linear saturating Gierer-Meinhardt reaction-diffusion PDE dA/dt = min(F_max, max(0, c_1 A + c_2 I + c_3)) - g_A A + D_A Lap(A), dI/dt = min(G_max, max(0, c_4 A + c_5)) - g_I I + D_I Lap(I), verifying the interior steady state (A*, I*) = (3.0, 2.5), critical diffusivity ratio d_c = 5.2 + 1.6*sqrt(10) = 10.2596, and intrinsic wavelength lambda_c = 3.4739 with 0.000% simulated wavelength error across the 5-regime P. semicirculatus doubling cascade (N = 3, 6, 12, 24 stripes for body lengths 2, 4, 8, 16 cm and N = 0 for subcritical control D_I = 0.050, RMSE = 0.0000), continuous growing-domain mid-trough stripe insertion (3 -> 6 -> 12 stripes), 2D P. imperator Y-junction horizontal unzipping (+0.6627 displacement converting 3 -> 4 posterior stripes), and automated CV segmentation of the CC BY-SA 4.0 juvenile Pomacanthus semicirculatus specimen (`pomacanthus_semicirculatus_specimen.jpg`, inter-stripe wavelength 3.80 mm = 36.11 px, primary-to-secondary prominence ratio 2.65x, bimodal wave correlation r = 0.858), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_004_pomacanthus_stripe_insertion.lean`. Overall 92.0/100 (faithfulness 92.1, reproducibility 91.9); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 91, Parameter expressivity 91, Morphometric validation 92, Source and data traceability 93, Code-to-model traceability 92, Reproducibility package 91. Output judged: docs/media/pomacanthus_stripe_insertion_comparison.png: rendered output of 1995-kondo-pomacanthus-stripe-insertion.py at 317bc3c, image/png, 1075667 B, 2310×1372 px, artifact_sha256 f56ad3b6f32a4c800405b224dcf0d9573c52ab752213d4ba7c15f304411e5faa (sha256 f56ad3b6f32a4c800405b224dcf0d9573c52ab752213d4ba7c15f304411e5faa), spec_fingerprint e4c6766f0513e073e4470f6a811662276c20929359a8102829c89d29daf6842b. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: e4c6766f0513e073e4470f6a811662276c20929359a8102829c89d29daf6842b; artifact_sha256: f56ad3b6f32a4c800405b224dcf0d9573c52ab752213d4ba7c15f304411e5faa; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/pomacanthus_stripe_insertion/pomacanthus_semicirculatus_specimen.jpg=5564f850c1905fb6..., datasets/pomacanthus_stripe_insertion/pomacanthus_stripe_insertion_reference.json=4e059d555df1a3d7..., datasets/pomacanthus_stripe_insertion/scout_manifest.json=bf877731da64b97b...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-pomacanthus-stripe-insertion-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Kondo & Asai (1995) Nature 376(6543):765-768 piecewise-linear saturating Gierer-Meinhardt reaction-diffusion PDE on an expanding skin domain L(t) = L_0 exp(gamma t), mid-trough secondary stripe insertion cascade (3 -> 6 -> 12 -> 24 stripes) in Pomacanthus semicirculatus, and 2D horizontal Y-junction branch point unzipping in Pomacanthus imperator | Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Kybernetik 12:30-39 short-range autocatalytic activation and long-range lateral inhibition; reconstructed_in_script: 1D and 2D IMEX spectral solvers for the Kondo-Asai piecewise-linear saturating PDE across stationary domain doubling scales s in {1, 2, 4, 8} (body length 2, 4, 8, 16 cm -> 3, 6, 12, 24 stripes), subcritical inhibitor-diffusion control D_I = 0.050 < d_c D_A (0 stripes), continuous growing-domain kymograph (3 -> 6 -> 12 stripes), and 2D Y-branch horizontal unzipping (3 -> 4 stripes, +0.663 domain fraction displacement) | Computer-vision segmentation of juvenile Pomacanthus semicirculatus specimen (`pomacanthus_semicirculatus_specimen.jpg`, CC BY-SA 4.0) extracting 115 inter-stripe spacings (3.80 mm mean wavelength at 40 mm body span, CV = 0.3435), alternating primary vs newly inserted secondary mid-trough stripe prominence ratio (2.65x), and bimodal Kondo-Asai waveform correlation (r = 0.858); transfer_boundary: 1D and 2D planar piecewise-linear reaction-diffusion PDE mapped to juvenile Pomacanthus semicirculatus lateral flank stripes and Pomacanthus imperator Y-junction dislocations; does_not_claim: Discrete chromatophore-level cell-cell contact-dependent depolarization or 3D curved body-fin boundary mechanics." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the macroscopic activator-inhibitor fields to discrete iridophore/melanophore agent interactions.",
            "remediation needed: Extend the 2D Kondo-Asai solver to a curvilinear C-shaped coordinate system on the juvenile Pomacanthus semicirculatus body outline to simulate concentric semicircular stripe curvature." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.92"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (primary) + Claude Sonnet 5.5 High (independent second assessor)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf orcid:0009-0007-4948-9192 ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

